    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/MarksStep.tsx",
      "content": "This clears edits made after the request started. Grid inputs remain enabled during saving, and clearing an already-saved cell removes its draft and records the empty input only in blanked. If another cell's pending save succeeds, this resets that empty input to the old saved price and can fold the grid because count is zero. Preserve blanked changes made during the request (and avoid folding over them), rather than clearing the entire set on any successful response.",
      "existing_code": "        if (ok) setBlanked(new Set());",
      "start_line": 482,
      "end_line": 482,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/MarksStep.tsx",
      "content": "Clearing a saved price leaves the cell permanently blank after blur: hold() removes empty prices from the drafts, leave() does not restore them, and both Save Marks and Discard are disabled when count is zero. Thus clearing the only edited cell makes an existing saved Mark look missing with no way to cancel the edit. Restore the saved value when an empty cell loses focus, or allow Discard to clear blanked state even when there are no drafts. Add a test for clearing a saved cell and then tabbing away.",
      "existing_code": "      if (savedPriceOf(key) !== undefined \u0026\u0026 price === '') next.add(rowId(key.instrumentKey, key.tradingDate));",
      "start_line": 462,
      "end_line": 462,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/MarksStep.tsx",
      "content": "Folding ignores dirtyIds. A user can enter a batch draft, open an earlier saved cell's Correct form and type a correction, then press Save Marks. If the batch completes the Review Date's Marks, this return unmounts CellEditor and silently loses the correction's locally held price/reason. Prevent folding while a correction is dirty, or block the batch save until that correction is saved or cancelled; cover this overlap in a test.",
      "existing_code": "  const folded = afterSave \u0026\u0026 toGo === 0;",
